Messages you send while an agent works now wait in the queue, where you can edit or cancel them, and reach the agent at its next pause. On a tablet you can switch and manage PCs from the drawer, and a folder's files and source control open right from its row. Times show on the 24-hour clock, sorting is remembered per level, and back always leads somewhere. An interrupted answer stays whole, and a conversation no longer jumps to the top when opened.